```
package.json:4:3 lint/nursery/usePackageJsonValidCpu ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! This entry of the cpu field is empty or contains only spaces.
  
    2 │ 	"name": "my-package",
    3 │ 	"cpu": [
  > 4 │ 		"",
      │ 		^^
    5 │ 		"  ",
    6 │ 		true,
  
  i Package managers compare each entry with the processor type of the machine to decide whether the package can be installed there. An entry that isn't a processor type never matches, so the package may be installed on, or refused by, the wrong machines.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Replace the entry with one of the following processor types, in quotes. To exclude a processor type instead, add ! before its name.
  
  - arm
  - arm64
  - ia32
  - loong64
  - mips
  - mipsel
  - ppc64
  - riscv64
  - s390
  - s390x
  - x64
  

